e,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":8089024095,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAAB4iS2Xw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.4","name":"cherrypick:4.4","color":"446699","default":false,"description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.4.x release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":7,"created_at":"2025-03-27T08:50:54Z","updated_at":"2025-06-14T16:21:04Z","closed_at":"2025-04-15T00:42:51Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104689","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104689","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104689.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104689.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-15T00:42:51Z"},"body":"Fixes #104180\r\n\r\nAs [the discussions](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104180#issuecomment-2727647043) from the issue mention, when the engine invokes a Csharp script's `Get` or `Set` (through `CSharpInstanceBridge`), before the control flow goes to call the virtual `_Get` and `_Set`, a StringName proxy object is created and used as the method parameter. This allocation would be unnecessary if the engine user had not overridden the aforementioned virtual methods.\r\n\r\nThis PR adds guardian checks in `CSharpInstanceBridge.Get` and `CSharpInstanceBridge.Set` against `godotObject.HasGodotClassMethod(GodotObject.MethodName._Get.NativeValue.DangerousSelfRef)` and `godotObject.HasGodotClassMethod(GodotObject.MethodName._Set.NativeValue.DangerousSelfRef)`, to make sure the control flow returns if the target method was not overriden instead of allocating a StringName wrapper object and invoking the unimplemented empty virtual method.\r\n\r\n[MRP](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/19263124/StringNameLeak.zip) from the original issue\r\n\r\nBefore this PR:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f82109e4-d8a8-4a81-b3d2-029b9154bc0d)\r\n\r\nThis PR:\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ba2a642f-a633-42be-85c6-2f364a9dda17)\r\n","closed_by":{